OL,4,CTerror suspect teen denies making      
OL,5,Cexplosives                             
OL,6,GA teenager accused of making           
OL,7,Gexplosives has denied a series of      
OL,8,Gterror offences.                       
OL,10,FMario Weresi, from Norwich, is also    
OL,11,Faccused of possessing a firearm,       
OL,12,Fdistributing terror manuals and        
OL,13,Fstirring up racial hatred.             
OL,15,FThe 18-year-old pleaded not guilty to  
OL,16,F15 offences at the Old Bailey in       
OL,17,FLondon earlier and is due to stand     
OL,18,Ftrial next year.                       
OL,20,FHowever, Weresi admitted one charge of 
OL,21,Fcreating deepfake images of teenage    
OL,22,Fgirls.                            G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
