OL,4,CMotorist avoids jail after woman       
OL,5,Ckilled in crash                        
OL,6,GA driver who caused the death of a     
OL,7,Gwoman in Lincolnshire when he crossed  
OL,8,Gon to the wrong side of the road while 
OL,9,Ghe was distracted has been given a     
OL,10,Gsuspended jail sentence.               
OL,12,FCalum Drake, 22, from Stratton         
OL,13,FStrawless, near Norwich, was           
OL,14,Ftravelling south on the A15 near       
OL,15,FLeasingham when he failed to take a    
OL,16,Fleft-hand bend and drove straight on.  
OL,18,FHis Citroen C3 hit a Kia Picanto being 
OL,19,Fdriven by 22-year-old Hannah Curtis,   
OL,20,Ffrom Lincoln. She died 16 days later.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
